  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Recurrent Associative Cycle",
      "items": [
        "Normalized hidden state h projects into key k, value v, query q, and gating scalars (alpha, beta, z)",
        "Memory decay fades past matrix: S = alpha * S. Delta prediction subtracts predicted value v_hat = k @ S",
        "Memory update adds outer product: S += beta * (k (x) delta). Output query reads updated state: y = q @ S"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Chapter 2 KV Research Results",
      "items": [
        "Overlapping key directions create severe retrieval interference (L2 error = 1.0126 in 2D synthetic test)",
        "Orthogonal keys and independent vector slots yield exact 0.0000 retrieval error in controlled tests",
        "Storage trade-off: fixed matrix is 36 bytes (constant); orthogonal state scales linearly with slot count"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Robustness & Limitations",
      "items": [
        "Gaussian query noise degrades linear retrieval (L2 error rises from 0.0 to 1.7737 at sigma=1.0)",
        "Cosine confidence gating (tau=0.80) abstains on ambiguous queries, increasing accepted accuracy to 73.8%",
        "Standalone synthetic experiments: not integrated into the trained neural decoder"
      ]
    }
  ]
